out.push(S('Board clinic – typical mistakes'));
out.push(A('**1** ⚠ **A feeling** → **_I am more confident_; nobody can check it.**   **2** **A claim about other people** → **_I communicate better_, with no evidence from any of them.**   **3** ⚠ **Somebody else\'s change claimed** → **three of seven in this class.**   **4** **A sentence that cannot be false** → **_I have grown_.**   **5** ⚠ **_Are you sure?_ said to a student who reports nothing** → **the room now knows the expected answer.**   **6** **A checker inside this room** → **the checker must be somebody who has never read the book.**'));
