out.push(A('⚠ **Three instructions for this cycle, and the second is the one the room will fight.** **First: the page is made of counts, dates and documents, with the thanks in one line at the end.** **Second: no advice about teaching** — **a student who has never taught can be discounted in four seconds, and rightly, where a figure from the reader\'s own practice has to be dealt with.** **Third: no names and no course vocabulary, because the page outlives the room and the reader has the same book under different numbers.** **Then run 23.6\'s test on it: give it to one reader who teaches anything and ask which sentence they would act on, and count how many of the five are about the writer.**'));
