out.push(A('⚠ **Part 4 gives two tasks on the same five extracts and this class is now good at the first and loses marks on the second, because the second answer is usually in the last sentence.** **At 1 the nurse says she did not explain anything at all and gave six handovers, which is C, and the learner _does it perfectly and said she did not know_, which is E.** **At 2 the accountant explains for twenty minutes and never gives the thing to do on a Monday, which is A** — **and _he has reconciled after reporting every month since_ is D, not F: he is not doing the opposite of what he agreed, he is doing what he always did.** ⚠ **At 3 the word is _datum_, which is E, and the boy _asked what a datum was and did not use any of it_, which is B.** **At 4 she showed her on her own page, which is B, and the learner used it on a person, which is A** — **and this is the one pair in the set where both answers are the writer\'s own case from 24.2.** **At 5 the shopkeeper taught the move and when to use each, which is F, and the nephew taught it to his sister within nine days, which is C.** **Unused: D, G and H in Task One; F, G and H in Task Two.**'));
